        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Extracts the edge origin and target object references from the plane based on the",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "edge endpoints IDs.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The edge object is relevant only within the context of the plane that was used here, during",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "the initialisation. It should not be stored or shared.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "If the design object is not an edge, then the initialiser results in ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
